1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,570
There once was a stonecutter who wished to be the mightiest of all

2
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:10,150
One day a rich lord passed him by

3
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:14,160
If only I were him, he sighed

4
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,220
And so he was

5
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,900
But the sun beat down even on lords

6
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,020
I want to be the sun

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:26,470
So he became the sun and scorched the earth below

8
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:31,060
Until a cloud covered him

9
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:36,470
Then let me be the cloud

10
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:41,410
He rained and rained and flooded all the land

11
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:46,710
But one thing did not move

12
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:50,370
Let me be the mountain

13
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:54,820
Now he was mighty, unmoving

14
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:03,080
Until he felt something at his feet

15
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,450
A stonecutter

16
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:07,880
Let me be myself, he whispered

17
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:13,000
Whatever you become, something will seem greater

18
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:18,320
Peace begins with who you are
